<mxCell id="db-m02_2" value="&lt;b&gt;MongoDB physical schema, Crow&#x27;s Foot notation.&lt;/b&gt; Columns: field name | BSON data type | constraints&lt;br&gt;Line ends: &lt;b&gt;||&lt;/b&gt; exactly one &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;o|&lt;/b&gt; zero or one &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;o&amp;lt;&lt;/b&gt; zero or many. A reference leaves its row on the left; the referenced &lt;i&gt;id&lt;/i&gt; is entered on the right.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key (_id) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; ObjectId reference &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; unique index &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;NN&lt;/b&gt; required &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;= x&lt;/b&gt; default value &amp;nbsp; yellow row = compound unique index&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;String · enum X&lt;/i&gt; = string limited to the values of X (see the Enums page) &amp;nbsp; dashed grey box = collection from another module" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="900" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
